# TIDES passenger-events drop directory (handoff 0005, Path A of
# docs/connecting-your-data.md). Drop passenger_events*.csv here; the
# folder is scanned when the ingestion service starts, and handled files
# move into processed/.
#
# Agency operational data, never source: nothing in here is committed.
#
# THIS .gitignore IS TRACKED ON PURPOSE — see ../vendor-drop/.gitignore
# for why: an untracked bind-mount path is created by Docker as root, and
# the agency staffer copying an export in then hits permission denied.
*
!.gitignore
